28
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:51,204
Now, when we talk about the business side of things, whether this is supply chain or pricing or operations, I think we have not seen such a level of impact.

29
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:57,120
Primarily because one, the whole feedback loop a lot slower on the business side.

30
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:05,040
Code is something that you generate, you test it the next minute, you get a feedback, you learn from your mistakes, and you are able to improve faster.

31
00:03:05,230 --> 00:03:13,120
Where while on the business side, you do an intervention, whether people on the ground will follow it, not follow it, and what are their reasons for not following it.

32
