And coding is important, but it's not the world of business.

39
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:43,040
Absolutely.

40
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,000
It's like a small

41
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,212
it's an enabler, but it's not the business itself.

42
00:03:46,734 --> 00:03:47,200
Yeah.

43
